1	//! Thin Tauri adapter over the fixture and Gmail mail cores.
2	//!
3	//! `EMAIL_OS_MODE` selects the profile at launch (`fixture` by default, or
4	//! `gmail`). The two modes use separate app-data directories; Gmail credentials
5	//! stay in the OS Keychain and mailbox actions require verified user opt-in.
6	//! Fixture mode runs the Gmail core on the built-in synthetic provider; a
7	//! pre-existing legacy fixture database is retired once, with disclosure and a
8	//! verified backup (ADR 0002).
